     "document_id": "34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402",
     "chunk_id": "34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402-p63-1",
     "page": 63,
     "text": "GPU Programming: CUDA\n  CUDA Synchronization\n\n\n¡  __syncthreads()\n\n                                                        __shared__ float tile[256];   ¡  Scope: One CUDA block\n                                                        tile[threadIdx.x] = A[i];\n   ¡  Use: Tile coordination in the shared                                                        __syncthreads();\n     memory.\n                                                        use(tile);\n\n\n¡  Kernel boundary\n\n   ¡  Scope: Whole threads\n                                           ¡ Load data from global memory to shared memory.   ¡  Use: Global phase between kernels\n                                           ¡ Wait until all threads in the block complete the   ¡  Achieved by launching separate kernels\n                                              shared-memory load.",
     "preview_url": "/api/documents/34911c46e78edc833f283f8dd678b85d6f8c92d66859e6bf6886949181d95402/pages/63/preview",
